data:flow_radio_sl_unknown a iof:Shipment ;
    rdfs:label "Modelled flow: Skydio Connect SL radio module origin not established -> Skydio, Hayward" ;
    rdfs:comment "Modelled flow, not observed (no customs bill or purchase record). Origin not established: Skydio designs the SkydioLink module (FCC grantee), but where it is made is not public. China unlikely: section 848 of the FY2020 NDAA bars the Department of Defense from drones that use radios made in China, and a reseller guide describes the X10 as NDAA-compliant." ;
